cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QASP in your research, please cite this software and identify
  the version or commit used in your experiments.
type: software
title: "QASP: Quantum Agent Software Package"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sequeira"
    given-names: "André"
    email: "andre.m.sequeira@inesctec.pt"
    affiliation: "Quantum Software Engineering, HASLab, INESC TEC, Braga, Portugal"
version: "0.1.0"
# This is the current source version, not a published release.
# Add date-released and a DOI only when a release has been published/archived.
repository-code: "https://github.com/INESCTEC/qasp"
url: "https://github.com/INESCTEC/qasp"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for building, training and analyzing quantum circuit models
  for reinforcement learning, classification, quantum kernels, generative
  learning and combinatorial optimization, with differentiable IQP and
  Pauli propagation simulators.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum machine learning
  - reinforcement learning
  - quantum simulation
